{"id":"e05cfd1d67","t":"lord-level Assassin, I am the shadow","c":"ml+io:/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/01-11-193x278.jpg","n":111,"l":111,"s":["ml"],"k":{"ml":"lord-level-assassin-i-am-the-shadow"},"u":1795035113036,"desc":"في عام 2024، يندمج الواقع مع اللعبة، مما يسبب الفوضى والكوارث. حصل تشين فينج، الذي خانته حبيبته، على فرصة ثانية بعد الموت بفضل عدد كبير من العجائب. يولد من جديد كقاتل الظل، ويتعهد بالانتقام ويرتفع بدء، ويتقدم في المستوى بوتيرة لا يمكن إيقافها. في الظلام، يشق تشين فينج مسارًا جديدًا – مسار الانتقام والقوة والهيمنة.","type":"","status":"OnGoing","genres":["اعادة احياء","اكشن","خيال","دراما","فنون قتاليه"],"src":{"ml":"lord-level-assassin-i-am-the-shadow"},"chapters":{"1":{"ml":"lord-level-assassin-i-am-the-shadow|/manga/lord-level-assassin-i-am-the-shadow/1/"},"2":{"ml":"lord-level-assassin-i-am-the-shadow|/manga/lord-level-assassin-i-am-the-shadow/2/"},"3":{"ml":"lord-level-assassin-i-am-the-shadow|/manga/lord-level-assassin-i-am-the-shadow/3/"},"4":{"ml":"lord-level-assassin-i-am-the-shadow|/manga/lord-level-assassin-i-am-the-shadow/4/"},"5":{"ml":"lord-level-assassin-i-am-the-shadow|/manga/lord-level-assassin-i-am-the-shadow/5/"},"6":{"ml":"lord-level-assassin-i-am-the-shadow|/manga/lord-level-assassin-i-am-the-shadow/6/"},"7":{"ml":"lord-level-assassin-i-am-the-shadow|/manga/lord-level-assassin-i-am-the-shadow/7/"},"8":{"ml":"lord-level-assassin-i-am-the-shadow|/manga/lord-level-assassin-i-am-the-shadow/8/"},"9":{"ml":"lord-level-assassin-i-am-the-shadow|/manga/lord-level-assassin-i-am-the-shadow/9/"},"10":{"ml":"lord-level-assassin-i-am-the-shadow|/manga/lord-level-assassin-i-am-the-shadow/10/"},"11":{"ml":"lord-level-assassin-i-am-the-shadow|/manga/lord-level-assassin-i-am-the-shadow/11/"},"12":{"ml":"lord-level-assassin-i-am-the-shadow|/manga/lord-level-assassin-i-am-the-shadow/12/"},"13":{"ml":"lord-level-assassin-i-am-the-shadow|/manga/lord-level-assassin-i-am-the-shadow/13/"},"14":{"ml":"lord-level-assassin-i-am-the-shadow|/manga/lord-level